## one reply updates two sections in a row
write users at r0: {"ok": true, "revision": 1}
write stories at r0: {"ok": true, "revision": 1}
data-handling r0 open
stories r1 draft
users r1 draft
## the developer confirms both, then a later answer changes users
write users at r1: {"ok": true, "revision": 2}
data-handling r0 open
stories r1 needs_review / Depends on users: drivers added as users
users r2 needs_review / drivers added as users
## a section chat writes with the revision it read before that change
write users at r1 again: {"ok": false, "body": "Kitchen volunteers, the coordinator and drivers.", "reason": "stale", "revision": 2}
## 5 chats write the same section at once from r0, 20 rounds
rounds where more or fewer than one write landed: 0
